{"version":1,"key":"card:536","content":{"id":536,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"什么是领域？领域是长期持续关注，保持一定的标准，比如健康，需要持续关注，目标是保持身体健康而不是减少 5kg。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"人的精力有限，一定要确认好自己需要精进的领域，否则："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不明白自己的边界，把时间花在了一些无意义的事情上"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不知道和长期目标的关系，缺乏方向感，行动碎片化，优先级混乱，难以聚焦到重要的事项中"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不知道当前进展如何，难以迭代个人成长系统"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"无法建立系统，只有任务，比如在减完 10 斤后体重迅速反弹"}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"tip","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"把所有当前正在关注的领域摊平看下，看时间投入在了哪里，哪些不再需要投入时间，哪些需要投入更多时间。"}],"disableDrag":false}]}],"tags":["个人成长"],"createTime":1743413775808,"updateTime":1743416488099,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743416488099}}